{
  "name": "sfdc-virtual-folders",
  "displayName": "SFDC Virtual Folders",
  "description": "Virtual folders and tag-based views for Salesforce Apex classes and LWC components, based on @path and @tag annotations.",
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "publisher": "carlolomello",
  "license": "SEE LICENSE IN LICENSE",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/carlolomello/sfdc-virtual-folders.git"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.118.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other",
    "Visualization"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "salesforce",
    "sfdx",
    "apex",
    "lwc",
    "trigger",
    "uml",
    "diagram",
    "virtual folders",
    "tags"
  ],
  "galleryBanner": {
    "color": "#0b1329",
    "theme": "dark"
  },
  "icon": "resources/icon.png",
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished",
    "onView:sfdcVirtualApexFolders",
    "onView:sfdcVirtualApexTags",
    "onView:sfdcUmlDiagram",
    "onCommand:sfdcVirtualFolders.refresh",
    "onCommand:sfdcVirtualFolders.setPathForCurrentClass",
    "onCommand:sfdcVirtualTags.refresh",
    "onCommand:sfdcVirtualTags.filter",
    "onCommand:sfdcVirtualFolders.filterType",
    "onCommand:sfdcVirtualFolders.openUml"
  ],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "configuration": {
      "type": "object",
      "title": "SFDC Virtual Folders",
      "properties": {
        "sfdcVirtualFolders.autoRevealActiveClass": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Automatically reveal the active Apex class or LWC component files in the Virtual Folders view."
        }
      }
    },
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "sfdc-virtual-folders",
          "title": "SFDC Virtual Folders",
          "icon": "resources/icons/activity-bar.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "sfdc-virtual-folders": [
        {
          "id": "sfdcVirtualApexFolders",
          "name": "Virtual Folders"
        },
        {
          "id": "sfdcVirtualApexTags",
          "name": "Virtual Tags"
        },
        {
          "id": "sfdcUmlDiagram",
          "name": "Virtual UML"
        }
      ]
    },
    "viewsWelcome": [
      {
        "view": "sfdcVirtualApexFolders",
        "contents": "Virtual Folders organizza il tuo metadata Salesforce usando le annotazioni @path.\n\n[Set path for current file](command:sfdcVirtualFolders.setPathForCurrentClass)\n\n[Refresh](command:sfdcVirtualFolders.refresh)\n\nCome funziona:\n\n- Aggiungi @path My/Sub/Folder a una classe Apex o a un componente LWC\n- I file vengono raggruppati automaticamente nell'albero delle cartelle\n- Trascina un file su una cartella per aggiornarne il @path\n- Click destro su un file e scegli Set Path\n- Usa il filtro in alto per mostrare All / Apex / Trigger / LWC\n\nNessuna annotazione @path trovata nel progetto."
      },
      {
        "view": "sfdcVirtualApexTags",
        "contents": "Usa le annotazioni @tag per organizzare i file per temi trasversali.\n\n[Filter by tags](command:sfdcVirtualTags.filter)\n\n[Refresh](command:sfdcVirtualTags.refresh)\n\nCome funziona:\n\n- Aggiungi @tag myTag a qualsiasi file .cls, .trigger o .js (LWC)\n- I tag appaiono raggruppati in questa vista\n- Usa Filter Tags per cercare tag specifici (separati da virgola)\n\nNessuna annotazione @tag trovata nel progetto."
      },
      {
        "view": "sfdcUmlDiagram",
        "contents": "Visualizza le relazioni tra classi Apex, trigger e componenti LWC.\n\n[Open UML Diagram](command:sfdcVirtualFolders.openUml)\n\n[Refresh](command:sfdcVirtualFolders.refresh)\n\nTipi di relazione:\n\n- Extends: freccia continua (abstract: ambra, concrete: arancio)\n- Implements: freccia tratteggiata blu\n- Dependency: freccia tratteggiata grigia\n- Reference: freccia punteggiata\n\nApri un progetto Salesforce con classi Apex e componenti LWC per vedere il grafico UML."
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.refresh",
        "title": "Refresh Virtual Folders"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.setPathForCurrentClass",
        "title": "Set Virtual Path for Current Apex Class"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualTags.refresh",
        "title": "Refresh Virtual Tags"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualTags.filter",
        "title": "Filter Tags"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.filterType",
        "title": "Filter Virtual Folders by Type"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.deploySource",
        "title": "Deploy This Source"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.retrieveSource",
        "title": "Retrieve This Source"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.diffSource",
        "title": "Diff Source Against Org"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.deleteSource",
        "title": "Delete Source"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.openUml",
        "title": "Open UML Diagram"
      },
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.openToSide",
        "title": "Open to the Side"
      }
      ],
      "menus": {
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.refresh",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexFolders",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.filterType",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexFolders",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualTags.refresh",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexTags",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualTags.filter",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexTags",
          "group": "navigation"
        }
      ],
      "editor/context": [
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.setPathForCurrentClass",
          "when": "resourceExtname == .cls",
          "group": "navigation"
        }
      ],
      "explorer/context": [
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.setPathForCurrentClass",
          "when": "resourceExtname == .cls",
          "group": "navigation"
        }
      ],
      "view/item/context": [
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.deploySource",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexFolders && viewItem == 'virtualFile' && sf:has_target_org",
          "group": "1_salesforce@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.retrieveSource",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexFolders && viewItem == 'virtualFile' && sf:has_target_org",
          "group": "1_salesforce@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.diffSource",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexFolders && viewItem == 'virtualFile' && sf:has_target_org",
          "group": "1_salesforce@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.deleteSource",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexFolders && viewItem == 'virtualFile' && sf:has_target_org",
          "group": "1_salesforce@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.openToSide",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexFolders && viewItem == 'virtualFile'",
          "group": "2_navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.setPathForCurrentClass",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexFolders && viewItem == 'virtualFile' && resourceExtname == .cls",
          "group": "3_custom@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.deploySource",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexTags && viewItem == 'taggedResource' && sf:has_target_org",
          "group": "1_salesforce@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.retrieveSource",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexTags && viewItem == 'taggedResource' && sf:has_target_org",
          "group": "1_salesforce@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.diffSource",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexTags && viewItem == 'taggedResource' && sf:has_target_org",
          "group": "1_salesforce@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.deleteSource",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexTags && viewItem == 'taggedResource' && sf:has_target_org",
          "group": "1_salesforce@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.openToSide",
          "when": "view == sfdcVirtualApexTags && viewItem == 'taggedResource'",
          "group": "2_navigation@1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "keybindings": [
      {
        "command": "sfdcVirtualFolders.setPathForCurrentClass",
        "key": "cmd+alt+v",
        "mac": "cmd+alt+v",
        "when": "editorLangId == apex"
      }
    ]
  },
  "scripts": {
    "vscode:prepublish": "npm run compile",
    "compile": "tsc -p ./",
    "watch": "tsc -watch -p ./",
    "pretest": "npm run compile && npm run lint",
    "lint": "eslint src",
    "test": "vscode-test"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/mocha": "^10.0.10",
    "@types/node": "22.x",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.118.0",
    "@vscode/test-cli": "^0.0.11",
    "@vscode/test-electron": "^2.5.2",
    "eslint": "^9.39.3",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3",
    "typescript-eslint": "^8.56.1"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@joint/core": "^4.3.0"
  }
}
